        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Hans Fallada, John Buchan\n- Works: Every Man Dies Alone, Everyone Dies Alone\n- Places: Germany, Scotland\n\nFacts:\n- Hans Fallada wrote the novel \"Every Man Dies Alone.\"\n- The 2001 German film \"Everyone Dies Alone\" was inspired by \"Every Man Dies Alone.\"\n- Hans Fallada and John Buchan were not from the same country.\n- Hans Fallada was from Germany, while John Buchan was from Scotland.",
